        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_1000_friend_02",
      "hash64": "ADA751E7112C1B78",
      "text": "那就是零區閘口。\\c\\n是用來觀測帕底亞巨坑裡面……\\n所謂第零區的設施。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_1000_friend_03",
      "hash64": "ADA752E7112C1D2B",
      "text": "我們得從那裡面\\n下到巨坑去。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_1000_friend_06",
      "hash64": "ADA755E7112C2244",
      "text": "對了，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳帶著的那傢伙……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
